{
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "webhook_1",
      "provider": "webhook",
      "config": {
        "hideForm": true,
        "mode": "Source",
        "parameters": {},
        "type": "webhook"
      },
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 20, "y": 200 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "guardrails_1",
      "provider": "guardrails",
      "config": {
        "profile": "strict",
        "strict": {
          "policy_mode": "block",
          "max_tokens_estimate": 8000,
          "expected_format": "json"
        }
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "webhook_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 200, "y": 200 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_rocketride_1",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Nous Distiller: watched actions → parameterized Protocol. Pending only. No execution.",
        "instructions": [
          "You distill ONE watched handling session into a reusable Protocol. Never execute actions. Never create calendar events. Never send email/Slack. Never arm a protocol.",
          "Input JSON: {correlation_id, event_id?, watched:[{action,params}], event?}",
          "1) Hold input in memory_internal. Keep correlation_id forever; create UUID only if missing.",
          "2) Allowed actions ONLY: forward|label|archive|reply|book|send_message. Drop/reject any other action.",
          "3) Call tool_guild agent nous-distiller with: source_event {id, trigger_class, fields}, watched_receipts (1-based order), allowed_actions (full allowlist), owner_id.",
          "4) Expect a Protocol JSON: name, trigger_class, signature_example, preconditions (must include protocol.approved equals true), steps[{action,params}], postcondition.checks[{kind:receipt_exists,action}], risk.",
          "5) Parameterize one-off entity values as $variables. Stable owner policy destinations (e.g. accounting@myfirm.com) and stable labels (e.g. invoices) may remain.",
          "6) Write FalkorDB personal_brain with allow_writes: MERGE (:Protocol {id}) SET status='PENDING', approved=false, critic_verdict=null, steps_json, trigger_class, correlation_id. Link LEARNED_FROM Event if event_id present. Do NOT set approved=true.",
          "7) Optionally remember protocol summary via tool_laserdata_memory (namespace nous:protocols or nous:life-events).",
          "8) Return JSON only: {\"status\":\"pending_review\",\"protocol\":{...},\"correlation_id\":\"...\"}."
        ],
        "max_waves": 12,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "guardrails_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 420, "y": 200 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_openai_1",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "config": {
        "profile": "openai-4o-mini",
        "openai-4o-mini": { "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_OPENAI_KEY}" },
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "control": [
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" },
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "graph_falkordb_1" }
      ],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 420, "y": 20 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory_internal_1",
      "provider": "memory_internal",
      "config": { "type": "memory_internal" },
      "control": [{ "classType": "memory", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 420, "y": 380 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_guild_1",
      "provider": "tool_guild",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_guild",
        "baseUrl": "https://app.guild.ai",
        "apiKeyId": "${GUILD_API_KEY_ID}",
        "apiKeySecret": "${GUILD_API_KEY_SECRET}",
        "owner": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_OWNER}",
        "workspace": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_NAME}",
        "agent": "nous-distiller",
        "resultMode": "wait",
        "timeout": 300,
        "maxSessions": 5,
        "verifyTls": true
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 660, "y": 40 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "graph_falkordb_1",
      "provider": "graph_falkordb",
      "config": {
        "type": "graph_falkordb",
        "host": "${FALKOR_HOST}",
        "port": 6379,
        "username": "${FALKOR_USERNAME}",
        "password": "${FALKOR_PASSWORD}",
        "tls": false,
        "graph": "personal_brain",
        "db_description": "Nous personal brain: Protocol PENDING (not armed), Event, Person. Edges: LEARNED_FROM, HANDLES, TAUGHT_BY.",
        "allow_writes": true,
        "allow_execute": true,
        "max_attempts": 5,
        "max_rows": 250,
        "max_execute_rows": 25000,
        "query_timeout_ms": 30000
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 660, "y": 200 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_laserdata_memory_1",
      "provider": "tool_laserdata_memory",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_laserdata_memory",
        "profile": "cloud",
        "cloud": {
          "connection_string": "${LASER_CONNECTION_STRING}",
          "namespace": "nous:life-events",
          "show_advanced": true,
          "stream": "nous",
          "allow_namespace_override": true,
          "folded": true,
          "recall_limit": 20,
          "op_timeout": 30
        }
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 660, "y": 360 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "response_answers_1",
      "provider": "response_answers",
      "config": { "laneName": "result" },
      "input": [{ "lane": "answers", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 900, "y": 200 } }
    }
  ],
  "description": "Watched actions → Guild Distiller → Protocol PENDING in FalkorDB (not armed, no execute)",
  "project_id": "a11c0d15-7110-4b2e-9f01-d15a71000001",
  "viewport": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "zoom": 1 },
  "version": 1
}
